<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 900s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 10th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 900s, 541 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 170 were founded and 137 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Byzantine Empire, the Srivijaya Empire and the Abbasid Caliphate.</p></header>
